{"id":"n16478-2-5","stage":4,"title":"싹 · 全","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16478-2-5-1","ko":"너를 보니까 민준이 표정이 싹 바뀌네.","zh":"一看到你，敏俊的表情就完全变了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너를","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너를","audio":"/audio/439e524cbf5378e2d47a.mp3"}},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니까","audio":"/audio/da5702f163f863395e8e.mp3"}},{"text":"민준이","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이","audio":"/audio/32f61c157245f6426f6e.mp3"}},{"text":"표정이","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표정이","audio":"/audio/2d218cca6da1e76d9077.mp3"}},{"text":"싹","meaning":"全，彻底","explanation":"싹：全，彻底。","readings":[{"term":"싹","audio":"/audio/91eccc6ec16a647b4c89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16478","senseId":"2","lemma":"싹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싹","audio":"/audio/91eccc6ec16a647b4c89.mp3"}},{"text":"바뀌네.","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바뀌다：改变，转变，更改；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"바뀌다","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61179","senseId":"3","lemma":"바뀌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바뀌네","audio":"/audio/fad883dd91340b3442b8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"91eccc6ec16a647b","term":"싹","zh":"全，彻底","audio":"/audio/91eccc6ec16a647b4c89.mp3","entryId":"16478","definition":"完全不同地。","pronunciation":["싹"]},{"id":"5207e639323d4244","term":"바뀌다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5207e639323d4244d47e.mp3","entryId":"61179","definition":"内容或状态等变化或变样。","pronunciation":["바뀌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/343fe12ee5796fa680d6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16478-2-5-2","ko":"사실 어제 나랑 크게 싸웠거든.","zh":"其实昨天我和他大吵了一架。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사실","meaning":"事实上，其实","explanation":"사실：事实上，其实。","readings":[{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71275","senseId":"2","lemma":"사실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사실","audio":"/audio/c087c91deb495f97dbc6.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나랑","audio":"/audio/ba7570f9b8a80f0e0d15.mp3"}},{"text":"크게","meaning":"大，洪亮，嘹亮","explanation":"크다：大，洪亮，嘹亮；게：使前面的动作或